{
  "note": "Phase H cases: Jev steers, a general model writes the pipeline. A start state, an instruction, and what the folded state must be. `v` cases are in the pilot's vocabulary (the options say it all); `w` cases need text of their own. Each has a reference: the data stages of a table (optionally edited) and the chart commands, run by writer_eval --check to prove the expectation is reachable. Written before any decider or writer ran.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "v01",
      "start": {
        "mark": "bars"
      },
      "text": "make the bars red",
      "expect": {
        "colour": "red"
      },
      "reference": {
        "data": "classes",
        "commands": [
          "bars n --by label",
          "color #c44e52"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "v02",
      "start": {
        "mark": "bars"
      },
      "text": "which share does each class have?",
      "expect": {
